00:35:07.940 --> 00:35:11.230
There are no edges entering.

00:35:11.230 --> 00:35:12.759
And how about this graph?

00:35:12.759 --> 00:35:15.440
This is a little bit more complex.

00:35:15.440 --> 00:35:22.839
